  "summary": "MsgRail（消息轨道） —— DeepSeek Harness 的窄消息轨道插件：在对话左侧，为每条你发送的消息显示一根细横线。悬停看预览、点击即跳转，更早消息自动加载；全量历史、实时更新、中英双语。  MsgRail is a narrow message rail for DeepSeek Harness: one thin bar on the left of the chat for each message you sent. Hover to preview, click to jump — older messages load automatically. Full history, live, bilingual.",
